### Distribución del monto de contratos


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
# Histograma con colores MCCI: relleno rojo (#E8001C), borde oscuro para separar barras
# La escala logarítmica normaliza la distribución fuertemente sesgada de contratos
contratos_montos |>
  filter(costo > 0) |>
  ggplot(aes(x = log10(costo))) +
  geom_histogram(bins = 50, fill = "#E8001C", color = "#1A1A1A", alpha = 0.85,
                 linewidth = 0.25) +
  scale_x_continuous(
    breaks = 3:10,
    labels = c("$1K", "$10K", "$100K", "$1M", "$10M", "$100M", "$1B", "$10B")
  ) +
  scale_y_continuous(labels = label_comma()) +
  labs(
    title    = "Distribución de montos de contratos (escala logarítmica)",
    subtitle = "contratos_montos.csv — excluye contratos con costo = $0",
    x        = "Monto del contrato",
    y        = "Frecuencia",
    caption  = "Fuente: MCCI"
  ) +
  theme_minimal(base_size = 13) +
  theme(
    plot.title    = element_text(color = "#0d1b2a", face = "bold"),
    plot.subtitle = element_text(color = "#64748b"),
    axis.text     = element_text(color = "#1e293b")
  )
```

